ard__foot\"><span>6 min read</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"card article-card\" data-article=\"\" data-category=\"performanceCat\" data-reveal=\"\" data-search=\"A budget increase is not scaling Raising spend on a working campaign is the most common way to destroy one. Scaling is a procedure with preconditions, step sizes and stop rules. Performance\" href=\"/en/insights/budget-increase-is-not-scaling/\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"article-card__cover\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mark\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid slice\" viewbox=\"0 0 320 124\">\n<rect fill=\"url(#vzGrid)\" height=\"124\" opacity=\"0.5\" width=\"320\"></rect>\n<g>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.14)\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" width=\"24\" x=\"40\" y=\"76\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.14)\" height=\"38\" rx=\"3\" width=\"24\" x=\"76\" y=\"64\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.14)\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" width=\"24\" x=\"112\" y=\"68\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.26)\" height=\"54\" rx=\"3\" width=\"24\" x=\"148\" y=\"48\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.26)\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" width=\"24\" x=\"184\" y=\"52\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"#7b8cff\" height=\"74\" rx=\"3\" width=\"24\" x=\"220\" y=\"28\"></rect>\n<path d=\"M40 84 L88 72 L124 76 L160 54 L196 58 L232 34\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#a3b0ff\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\n<div class=\"article-card__top\"><span class=\"article-card__cat\">Performance</span><span class=\"article-card__meta num\">Jun 16, 2026</span></div>\n<h3 class=\"article-card__title\">A budget increase is not scaling</h3>\n<p class=\"article-card__excerpt\">Raising spen